    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald present this stunning 5 bed, 2.5 bath semi-detached family home in a very popular development on the coast, close to Bayside Shopping Centre and a host of amenities including great schools. The current owners have meticulously maintained this great property, so it comes to market in fantastic condition.\n\nThe accommodation briefly comprises of an entrance hallway, a spacious reception room which opens up to a living room, and a bright kitchen/dining area with direct access to the light filled sunroom. Finally, to the front a cosy family room along with a bathroom. Upstairs, there are five generously sized bedrooms, a family bathroom and shower room. The property also benefits from a private driveway to the front and a landscaped rear garden with block built shed fully fitted with electricity. The garden is complete with a paved patio and a well-maintained lawn, enjoying excellent privacy, not overlooked, perfect for outdoor relaxation. \n\nAlden Park is a well-established residential area just minutes from Sutton Cross. The area benefits from a wide selection of local amenities, including shops, schools, and parks, while being close to the scenic Dublin coastline. Excellent public transport links nearby include the DART at Sutton and Bayside, as well as frequent bus services to& from Dublin City Centre. Quick access to the M50, M1 and Dublin Airport. Sutton combines suburban tranquility with easy access to Dublin's vibrant lifestyle."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 2.2m x 1.7m\n\n\nHallway - 3.8m x 1.9m\nCarpet flooring, cloakroom.\n\nReception Room - 3.8m x 3.8m\nFireplace, carpet flooring, TV point.\n\nLiving Room - 5.8m x 4m\nFireplace, carpet flooring, TV point.\n\nKitchen - 6.7m x 2.7m\nTimber flooring, fitted kitchen, integrated NEFF double oven & microwave, integrated NEFF hob.\n\nBathroom - 1.6m x 1.58m\nWC, WHB with storage press.\n\nFamily Room - 4.8m x 2.7m\nTimber flooring, TV point.\n\nSun Room - 5.8m x 2.4m\nLaminated timber effect flooring.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nLanding - 3.4m x 3m\nCarpet flooring, access to attic.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.10m x 3.2m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring to the front of the property with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.7m x 3m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring to the rear of the property with fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 3.3m x 2.7m\nDouble bedroom with carpet flooring to the front of the property with fitted wardrobes.\n\nShower Room - 1.7m x 1.4m\nWC, WHB, electric shower, tiled walls, tiled flooring, extractor fan.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.6m x 2.4m\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 5 - 2.8m x 2.7m\nCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes.\n\nOutside - \n\n\nFront Garden - \nPaved Patio, private off street parking, mature hedging, lawn.\n\nRear Garden - \nSouth facing rear garden, meticulously maintained flower beds and hedging, lawn, block built shed with electricity.\n\n"
      },
